    "type": "question",
    "label": "18",
    "prompt": "A certain drug is found to be helpful for 70% of patients who take it. Two research teams are attempting to improve its effectiveness by adjusting the delivery system for the drug.\n\nBoth conduct random trials to test the effectiveness of their changes.\n\nTeam A runs a trial with 50 patients, of whom 45 show improvement using the drug.\n\nTeam B runs a trial with 90 patients, of whom 74 show improvement.\n\nUse the mean and standard deviation of the two trials to decide which adjustment shows stronger evidence of an improvement. Give calculated standard deviations and standardised differences to 1 decimal place, retaining unrounded values in calculations.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Team A: $\\mu_A=35$, $\\sigma_A\\approx3.2$; its result is approximately $3.1$ standard deviations above its mean. Team B: $\\mu_B=63$, $\\sigma_B\\approx4.3$; its result is approximately $2.5$ standard deviations above its mean. Team A shows stronger evidence of improvement. Further trials are needed.",
      "worked": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p49-q18-answer-a-model",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "right",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Under the original effectiveness of 70%, Team A: ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "X_A\\sim B(50,0.7)",
                "display": false
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q18-answer-a-working",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "right",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\mu_A&=50(0.7)=35\\\\\\sigma_A&=\\sqrt{50(0.7)(0.3)}\\approx3.2\\\\z_A&=\\frac{45-35}{\\sqrt{50(0.7)(0.3)}}\\approx3.1\\end{aligned}",
                "display": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p49-q18-answer-b-model",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "right",
            "spaceBefore": 5,
